id: pm-rust-invalid-guard-fallback
title: Align malformed mutation guard settings fallback with the oracle
description: "Beyond an explicit null guard, the published 2026.11.18 CLI warns with settings_read_invalid_schema and continues with default settings for a scalar guard, an array guard, or a null threshold. The native typed mutation decoder rejects those shapes. Align the broader invalid-settings policy with the oracle while preserving intentional native validation boundaries."
